<title>USA: Ingram Micro names Grainger CFO.</title>
<headline>Ingram Micro names Grainger CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA, Calif. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ingram Micro Inc said Michael Grainger was named chief financial officer effective immediately.</p>
<p>Grainger has served as the company's acting chief financial officer for the past few months and previously served as vice president and controller of its affiliate, Ingram Industries, in Nashville, Tennessee.</p>
